cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "osaa-metrics"
abstract: >-
  A chat-native pair-analyst over official statistics. The library pairs a
  long-format indicator table with a Boring Semantic Layer model so that an
  analyst, working through a conversational agent, can assemble a working set
  of indicators, pivot them into a wide core table, define a semantic model
  over it, and compose queries and charts at runtime — rather than consuming a
  fixed set of dashboards. It is delivered as a Python package with a Model
  Context Protocol server.
